              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oteho omutima kubiheesha, nooreebera aha ky'okureeberaho kyabyo, eki oyorekyeirwe aha rushozi oru.",
          "type": "text",
